      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="#faq" class="hover:text-[#159A9C] transition-colors">FAQ</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="#contact" class="hover:text-[#159A9C] transition-colors"
          >Kontakt</a
        >
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 shrink-0">
      <a
        href="tel:+48502732306"
        class="hidden lg:inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#1AA3A5] text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold text-lg hover:bg-[#2BB8BA] hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-[#1AA3A5]/35 transition-all shadow-md whitespace-nowrap"
      >
        <svg
          class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0"
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          fill="none"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z"
          ></path>
        </svg>
        Zadzwoń
      </a>

      <button
        id="mobile-menu-btn"
        class="lg:hidden p-1 text-[#002333] hover:text-[#159A9C] focus:outline-none transition-colors"
        aria-label="Otwórz menu"
        aria-expanded="false"
        aria-controls="mobile-menu"
      >
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          class="h-12 w-12 sm:h-14 sm:w-14"
          fill="none"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          stroke="currentColor"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            stroke-width="2"
            d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"></path>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <header
    class="relative bg-[#002333] text-white rounded-3xl md:rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden mb-8 shadow-2xl mt-4"
  >
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <img
        src="/img/tlo3.webp"
        alt="Złomowisko Drozd w Policach"
        width="575"
        height="339"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-40"
        fetchpriority="high"
      />
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#002333] via-[#002333]/92 to-[#002333]/65"
      >
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="relative z-10 p-8 md:p-16 lg:p-20 text-center md:text-left flex flex-col md:w-2/3"
    >
      <h1
        class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black mb-5 leading-tight tracking-tight"
      >
        Skup złomu <span class="text-[#159A9C]">Police</span>
      </h1>
      <p
        class="text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl mb-8 text-white/95 font-normal max-w-2xl leading-relaxed"
      >
        Złomowisko przy <strong class="font-semibold text-white">ul.&nbsp;Starzyńskiego&nbsp;15</strong>.
        Skup i&nbsp;odbiór złomu, legalizowana waga oraz <strong class="font-semibold text-white">płatność od&nbsp;ręki</strong>.
        Sprzedajemy też piasek i&nbsp;kruszywa w&nbsp;Policach i&nbsp;okolicach Szczecina.
      </p>
      <div
        class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center md:justify-start"
      >
        <a
          href="tel:502732306"
          class="bg-[#1AA3A5] hover:bg-[#2BB8BA] hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#1AA3A5]/40 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-bold text-lg transition-all shadow-lg shadow-[#1AA3A5]/25 text-center"
          >Zadzwoń: 502 732 306</a
        >
        <a
          href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/BZ1tgPHYC2gcyn8u6"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-bold text-lg transition-colors border border-white/20 text-center"
          >Jak dojechać</a
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div
    class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 md:gap-4 mb-10 text-center"
  >
    <div
      class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-4 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
    >
      <svg
        class="w-5 h-5 text-teal-600 shrink-0"
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        fill="none"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="1.75"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <path
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          d="M12 3v3m0 0a3 3 0 013 3v1H9V9a3 3 0 013-3zm-7 8h14M5 14l2 7h10l2-7M12 6V3"
        ></path>
      </svg>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#002333]">Legalna waga</p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-4 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
    >
      <svg
        class="w-5 h-5 text-teal-600 shrink-0"
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        fill="none"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="1.75"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <path
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          d="M17 9V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2m2 4h10a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm7-5a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"
        ></path>
      </svg>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#002333]">Płatność od ręki</p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-4 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
    >
      <svg
        class="w-5 h-5 text-teal-600 shrink-0"
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        fill="none"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="1.75"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <path
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          d="M20 7l-8-4-8 4m16 0l-8 4m8-4v10l-8 4m0-10L4 7m8 4v10M4 7v10l8 4"
        ></path>
      </svg>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#002333]">Odbiór złomu</p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-4 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
    >
      <svg
        class="w-5 h-5 text-teal-600 shrink-0"
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        fill="none"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="1.75"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <path
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          d="M8 17a2 2 0 104 0m-4 0a2 2 0 114 0m-4 0H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V9a2 2 0 012-2h9v10m3-10h2.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l2.414 2.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V15a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1m0 0a2 2 0 104 0m-4 0a2 2 0 114 0"
        ></path>
      </svg>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#002333]">Transport kruszyw</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section id="zlom" class="py-8 md:py-14 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div
      class="relative rounded-3xl md:rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl bg-[#002333]"
    >
      <img
        src="/img/tlo4.webp"
        alt="Skup złomu i metali kolorowych w Policach"
        width="1200"
        height="799"
        class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-40"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#002333] via-[#002333]/90 to-[#002333]/60"
      >
      </div>

      <div
        class="relative z-10 p-8 md:p-14 lg:p-16 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center"
      >
        <div class="text-center lg:text-left">
          <h2
            class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-white mb-5 leading-tight tracking-tight"
          >
            Złom<br /><span class="text-[#159A9C]">w Policach</span>
          </h2>
          <p
            class="text-base md:text-lg text-white/95 font-normal mb-6 max-w-md mx-auto lg:mx-0 leading-relaxed"
          >
            Skupujemy złom stalowy i&nbsp;metale kolorowe. Na placu czeka
            <strong class="font-semibold text-white">legalizowana waga</strong>,
            uczciwa klasyfikacja i&nbsp;<strong class="font-semibold text-white">gotówka od&nbsp;ręki</strong>.
            Przy większych ilościach możemy zapewnić odbiór złomu.
          </p>
          <a
            href="/oferta#zlom"
            class="inline-block bg-[#1AA3A5] hover:bg-[#2BB8BA] hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#1AA3A5]/40 text-white px-10 py-4 rounded-full font-bold text-lg transition-all shadow-lg shadow-[#1AA3A5]/25"
          >
            Pełna oferta złomu
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 text-center lg:text-left">
          <div
            class="bg-[#0a1922]/80 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-7 md:p-8 border border-white/10"
          >
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">Złom stalowy</h3>
            <ul
              class="list-disc list-outside text-slate-100 text-base space-y-1.5 marker:text-[#1AA3A5]"
            >
              <li>Złom ciężki i lekki</li>
              <li>Blachy i żeliwo</li>
              <li>Stal wsadowa i niewsadowa</li>
              <li>Konstrukcje (każdy gabaryt)</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div
            class="bg-[#0a1922]/80 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-7 md:p-8 border border-white/10"
          >
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">Metale kolorowe</h3>
            <ul
              class="list-disc list-outside text-slate-100 text-base space-y-1.5 marker:text-[#1AA3A5]"
            >
              <li>Miedź, mosiądz, brąz</li>
              <li>Aluminium i puszki po napojach</li>
              <li>Ołów i cynk</li>
              <li>Akumulatory ołowiowe</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="piasek" class="py-8 md:py-14 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div
      class="relative rounded-3xl md:rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl bg-[#0a3d42]"
    >
      <img
        src="/img/tlo2.webp"
        alt="Piasek i kruszywa Police"
        width="614"
        height="412"
        class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-35"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-bl from-[#0a3d42] via-[#0a3d42]/90 to-[#002333]/55"
      >
      </div>

      <div
        class="relative z-10 p-8 md:p-14 lg:p-16 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center"
      >
        <div class="order-1 lg:order-2 text-center lg:text-right">
          <h2
            class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-white mb-4 leading-tight tracking-tight"
          >
            Piasek<br /><span class="text-[#159A9C]">i kruszywa</span>
          </h2>
          <p
            class="text-[#2BB8BA] text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold mb-5 tracking-wide"
          >
            Szybki transport z Polic
          </p>
          <p
            class="text-base md:text-lg text-white/95 font-normal mb-8 max-w-md mx-auto lg:ml-auto lg:mr-0 leading-relaxed"
          >
            Sprzedajemy piasek, żwir i&nbsp;kruszywa budowlane dla budów oraz
            prywatnych posesji. Zapewniamy <strong class="font-semibold text-white">kontakt do sprawdzonych kierowców</strong> z&nbsp;wywrotkami
            (Police i&nbsp;okolice).
          </p>
          <a
            href="/oferta#piasek"
            class="inline-block bg-[#1AA3A5] hover:bg-[#2BB8BA] hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#1AA3A5]/40 text-white px-10 py-4 rounded-full font-bold text-lg transition-all shadow-lg shadow-[#1AA3A5]/25"
          >
            Pełna oferta kruszyw
          </a>
        </div>

        <div
          class="flex flex-col gap-5 order-2 lg:order-1 text-center lg:text-left"
        >
          <div
            class="bg-[#0a1922]/80 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-7 md:p-8 border border-white/10"
          >
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">Rodzaje piasku</h3>
            <ul
              class="list-disc list-outside text-slate-100 text-base space-y-1.5 marker:text-[#1AA3A5]"
            >
              <li>Piasek płukany (0-2 mm)</li>
              <li>Piasek do wylewek i murowania</li>
              <li>Piasek zasypowy na fundamenty</li>
              <li>Czysty piasek do piaskownic</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div
            class="bg-[#0a1922]/80 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-7 md:p-8 border border-white/10"
          >
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">Żwiry i kruszywa</h3>
            <ul
              class="list-disc list-outside text-slate-100 text-base space-y-1.5 marker:text-[#1AA3A5]"
            >
              <li>Żwiry płukane (2-8, 8-16, 16-32 mm)</li>
              <li>Kruszywa łamane</li>
              <li>Tłuczeń drogowy</li>
              <li>Mieszanki podbudowowe</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section
    id="faq"
    class="py-8 md:py-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto w-full px-4 sm:px-6"
  >
    <div class="text-center mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-[#002333]">
        Najczęstsze pytania
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-[#002333]/70 mt-3">
        Krótko o skupie złomu, odbiorze i piasku w Policach.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <details
        class="group rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-5 py-4 open:bg-white open:shadow-sm"
      >
        <summary
          class="cursor-pointer font-bold text-[#002333] text-lg list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-3 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"
        >
          Gdzie znajduje się skup złomu Drozd i w jakich godzinach pracujecie?
          <span class="text-[#159A9C] text-xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform"
            >+</span
          >
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Nasz plac mieści się przy{" "}
          <a
            href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/BZ1tgPHYC2gcyn8u6"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="font-semibold text-[#002333] underline underline-offset-2 decoration-teal-600/50 hover:text-teal-700 transition-colors"
            >ul. Starzyńskiego 15 w Policach</a
          >{" "}
          (wygodny wjazd również dla aut dostawczych i z przyczepką). Pracujemy
          od poniedziałku do piątku w godz. 8:00–15:00 oraz w soboty od 8:00 do
          13:00.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details
        class="group rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-5 py-4 open:bg-white open:shadow-sm"
      >
        <summary
          class="cursor-pointer font-bold text-[#002333] text-lg list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-3 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"
        >
          Czy przyjmujecie mniejsze ilości złomu od osób prywatnych?
          <span class="text-[#159A9C] text-xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform"
            >+</span
          >
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Tak, obsługujemy zarówno firmy, jak i klientów indywidualnych. Możesz
          przywieźć do nas każdą ilość materiału — od drobnych metali kolorowych
          (miedź, mosiądz, puszki aluminiowe, akumulatory) po stare grzejniki,
          rury, piece czy blachę po remoncie.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details
        class="group rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-5 py-4 open:bg-white open:shadow-sm"
      >
        <summary
          class="cursor-pointer font-bold text-[#002333] text-lg list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-3 [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"
        >
          Jak wygląda wycena i płatność za przywieziony złom?
          <span class="text-[#159A9C] text-xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform"
            >+</span
          >
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Surowiec ważymy na miejscu na legalizowanej wadze i uczciwie
          klasyfikujemy według aktualnego cennika. Za przywieziony złom płacimy
